                                    content: "Think about one area of your life you want to improve. Now identify ONE tiny thing you could improve by just 1% today.\n\nExamples:\n• Fitness: Do one more push-up than yesterday\n• Writing: Write 10 more words\n• Reading: Read for one more minute\n• Mindfulness: Add 30 seconds to meditation\n• Business: Make one extra sales call\n\nWhat's your 1% improvement for today?",
