                                    type: "takeaway",
                                    title: "Key Insight",
                                    content: "**Seek First to Understand, Then to Be Understood**: Empathic listening is the key to effective communication.\n\nMost communication problems come from poor listening—filtering others through our own experience. Empathic listening enters their frame of reference.\n\nKey practices:\n- Listen to understand, not to reply\n- Reflect feeling, not just content\n- Avoid autobiographical responses\n- Earn the right to be heard by understanding first\n\n*\"When you listen with empathy to another person, you give that person psychological air.\"*"
