                                    content: "Why are so many elite Canadian hockey players born in January, February, and March? The answer reveals one of the most powerful forces shaping success: cumulative advantage. Small early advantages compound over time into massive differences. This is the Matthew Effect, named after the biblical verse: 'For unto everyone that hath shall be given.'"
