                                    title: "Key Insight",
                                    content: "You've been 'hypnotized' by negative beliefs about yourself—suggestions that were accepted without examination and repeated until they felt like facts. These beliefs aren't true; they're just familiar. Dehypnotize yourself by questioning their origins, examining the evidence, and deliberately installing new beliefs through repetition and imagination."
