                                    content: "**The problem with logic:**\n\nWhen someone says 'The trauma was 20 years ago, just move on,' they're asking the rational brain to override the survival brain.\n\n**But:**\n• The survival brain doesn't understand time\n• It doesn't respond to words or logic\n• It only responds to SAFETY signals from the body\n\n**Brain scan evidence:** When trauma survivors see reminders of their trauma, their rational brain (prefrontal cortex) actually goes OFFLINE. They literally can't think clearly.\n\n**The insight:** Healing requires body-based approaches, not just talk."
