                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Eat Food (Not 'Edible Food-Like Substances')",
                                    content: "**The first rule:** Eat REAL food.\n\n**What is food?**\n• Your great-grandmother would recognize it\n• It will eventually rot\n• It has five or fewer ingredients\n• Ingredients are pronounceable\n\n**What is NOT food (but is eaten anyway):**\n• Highly processed products\n• Items with endless ingredient lists\n• Things that never spoil\n• Products your ancestors wouldn't recognize\n\n**Pollan's term:** 'Edible food-like substances'—they look like food but are industrial products designed for profit, not health."
