                                    title: "The 4-7-8 Technique (For Sleep & Calm)",
                                    content: "Developed by Dr. Andrew Weil, this is one of the most effective calming techniques:\n\n**The pattern:**\n• Inhale through nose: 4 seconds\n• Hold: 7 seconds\n• Exhale through mouth: 8 seconds\n• Repeat 4 times\n\n**Why it works:**\n• Extended exhale activates vagus nerve\n• Hold builds CO2 tolerance\n• The ratio forces slow breathing\n• Creates a 'tranquilizing' effect\n\n**Best for:** Falling asleep, calming anxiety, before stressful events. Some call it a 'natural tranquilizer.'"
