                                    title: "The Problem with Traditional Metrics",
                                    content: "Traditional metrics can deceive:\n\n- **Lines of code written** - More code isn't better\n- **Features shipped** - Features customers don't use are waste\n- **Hours worked** - Effort without learning is wasted effort\n- **Milestones hit** - Plans based on false assumptions\n\n**Vanity metrics** make you feel good but don't tell you if you're building something people want."
