                                    type: "application",
                                    title: "Designing Your BML Loop",
                                    content: "**For your current project:**\n\n1. **Identify your riskiest assumption** - What must be true?\n\n2. **Define the learning goal** - What specific question to answer?\n\n3. **Choose a metric** - What data would answer it?\n\n4. **Design the minimal build** - Least effort to get that data\n\n5. **Set a time limit** - Force yourself to learn fast\n\n6. **Pre-commit to next steps** - \"If X, we pivot. If Y, we persevere.\""
