                                    type: "application",
                                    title: "Finding Your Secret",
                                    content: "**Two types of secrets:**\n\n**Secrets about nature:**\n- Scientific discoveries\n- What does the world work?\n\n**Secrets about people:**\n- What do people want but not say?\n- What are they not doing that they should?\n\n**Questions to find secrets:**\n1. What is forbidden or taboo to talk about?\n2. What are people pretending is fine but isn't?\n3. What do experts assume that might be wrong?\n4. What would you think if you had no preconceptions?"
