                                    type: "takeaway",
                                    title: "Key Takeaways",
                                    content: "**Building the Future:**\n\nâœ“ **Secrets exist** - Between conventions and mysteries\n\nâœ“ **Great companies are built on secrets** - Truths others don't see\n\nâœ“ **Foundations can't be fixed later** - Get co-founders, equity, culture right\n\nâœ“ **Be a definite optimist** - Plan to make the future better\n\nâœ“ **Ask the hard questions** - What is taboo? What are experts wrong about?\n\n*\"The best entrepreneurs know this: every great business is built around a secret that's hidden from the outside.\"*"
