                                    content: "Dale Carnegie spent decades studying human interaction and discovered a fundamental truth:\n\n**People don't respond to criticism, condemnation, or complaints.**\n\nThey respond to appreciation, sincere interest, and feeling important. This first principle is the foundation of all successful human relations.\n\n*\"Any fool can criticize, condemn, and complain—and most fools do.\"*"
