                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Principle 2: Give Honest, Sincere Appreciation",
                                    content: "**The deepest urge in human nature:**\n\n*\"The desire to be important\"* — John Dewey\n\n**What appreciation does:**\n- Makes people feel valued\n- Motivates without manipulation\n- Creates loyalty and cooperation\n\n**Key distinction:**\n- **Flattery** = Insincere, selfish, universally condemned\n- **Appreciation** = Sincere, heartfelt, universally admired\n\n*\"I consider my ability to arouse enthusiasm among my people the greatest asset I possess.\"* — Charles Schwab"
