                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Principle 3: Arouse in the Other Person an Eager Want",
                                    content: "**The only way to influence people:**\n\nTalk about what **they** want and show them how to get it.\n\n**Why this works:**\n- Everyone is tuned to WIIFM (What's In It For Me?)\n- People act for their reasons, not yours\n- Your job: Connect your goals to their desires\n\n**Example:**\nDon't say: \"I want you to work overtime.\"\nSay: \"Here's how this project could lead to your promotion.\""
