                                    content: "Every salesperson and negotiator is trained to get the other person saying \"yes.\" Build momentum! Get buy-in!\n\n**Big problem**: People have become immune to this. When someone starts guiding you toward yes, your defenses go up.\n\nChris Voss discovered something counter-intuitive: **\"No\" is more valuable than \"yes.\"** Getting someone to say no makes them feel safe, in control, and more willing to engage."
