                                    content: "**Anchoring** means the first number mentioned heavily influences the final number. The lesson? Set an extreme anchor early.\n\nIf you want $100K:\n- Don't start at $100K (you'll negotiate down)\n- Start at $150K and let them \"win\" by getting it down\n\n**Important**: Your anchor must be defensible. Have reasons ready:\n*\"Our premium package is $150K because it includes X, Y, and Z that most clients eventually need anyway.\"*\n\nExtreme but justified anchors reshape the entire negotiation range."
