                                    content: "Capitalism isn't just an economic system. It's a revolutionary way of thinking about the future.\n\nBefore capitalism, most people believed the economy was static. If you got richer, someone else got poorer. Total wealth was fixed.\n\nCapitalism introduced a radical idea: the pie can grow. Through investment and innovation, we can create MORE wealth, not just redistribute existing wealth.\n\nThis belief transformed the world.",
