                                    content: "This is not the end. This is the beginning.\n\n**Remember these truths:**\n\n1. **You were born curious.** You can reclaim that birthright.\n\n2. **Understanding beats knowing.** Names are labels; wisdom is in the mechanics.\n\n3. **You are the easiest person to fool.** Stay honest with yourself.\n\n4. **Doing beats reading.** Get your hands dirty.\n\n5. **Questions deserve respect.** Even when directed at authority.\n\n6. **Joy sustains learning.** Make it play, not work.\n\n**Your mission, should you choose to accept it:**\n\nLive curiously. Think from first principles. Stay honest with yourself. Learn by doing. Question respectfully. Find joy in the process.\n\n**And above all:**\n\n**Go find things out.**\n\n— The Spirit of Richard Feynman",
