                                    type: "intro",
                                    title: "A Tour of Your Brain",
                                    content: "Imagine holding a 3-pound organ that contains your entire personality, every memory you've ever formed, all your skills, hopes, and dreams. Your brain has the consistency of firm jelly, yet it orchestrates every heartbeat, every breath, every thought. Different regions specialize in different functions—damage one area and you might lose language; damage another and you might not recognize faces. Let's map this remarkable landscape."
