                                    content: "Bones are far from the static, lifeless structures many imagine. They are **living, dynamic organs** constantly remodeling in response to stress, healing from damage, and adapting to the demands placed on them. For athletes, bone health directly impacts performance, injury risk, and long-term career longevity."
