                                    type: "application",
                                    title: "Build Your Critical Thinking Habit",
                                    content: "Start training your critical thinking today:\n\n**1. The 10-Second Pause**\nBefore sharing any article or news, pause 10 seconds and ask: \"Is this actually true? What's the source?\"\n\n**2. Devil's Advocate**\nOnce daily, argue the opposite of your own position. Feel uncomfortable? Good - you're growing.\n\n**3. The \"Says Who?\" Rule**\nWhen you hear a claim, ask: Who says? What's their evidence? What's their motivation?\n\n**4. Belief Inventory**\nPick one belief you hold strongly. Ask: \"How would I know if I was wrong?\"\n\n**5. Steel Man Practice**\nInstead of attacking the weakest version of opposing views, try to state them in their strongest form.",
