                                    content: "**Headline**: \"Famous Actor: 'Organic food cured my depression'\"\nðŸš¨ **Appeal to Authority** - Acting expertise doesn't transfer to nutrition/mental health\n\n**Political Speech**: \"My opponent wants open borders and to let criminals run free!\"\nðŸš¨ **Straw Man** - Distorting moderate immigration policy into an extreme\n\n**Social Media**: \"Oh, so you drive a car? Then you can't lecture me about climate change!\"\nðŸš¨ **Ad Hominem** - Attacking the person's behavior instead of addressing climate science\n\n**Debate**: \"You're either 100% pro-free-speech or you're a fascist.\"\nðŸš¨ **False Dilemma** - Ignores nuanced positions on speech limits",
