                                    content: "So far, you've learned to DETECT bad reasoning in others and yourself. Now it's time to BUILD good arguments.\n\nA sound argument isn't just about winning debates. It's about **thinking clearly** - organizing your thoughts in a way that leads to true conclusions.\n\nWhen you can construct a valid argument, you can:\n• Persuade without manipulation\n• Test your own ideas rigorously\n• Communicate complex ideas clearly\n• Separate what you BELIEVE from what you can PROVE\n\nLet's learn the architecture of logical reasoning.",
