                                    content: "Build these habits into your daily routine:\n\n**MORNING: Intention Setting**\n• Review one bias or fallacy before starting work\n• Remind yourself: \"I will question my assumptions today\"\n\n**DURING THE DAY: Active Practice**\n• When consuming news: \"What's the source? What's missing?\"\n• When making decisions: \"What would change my mind?\"\n• When in disagreement: \"Can I state their view fairly?\"\n\n**EVENING: Reflection**\n• What did I believe too quickly today?\n• Where did I resist changing my mind?\n• What would a devil's advocate say about my day?\n\n**Weekly**: Pick one belief and actively try to disprove it.",
