                                    explanation: "The three pillars work in sequence: Crawl â†’ Index â†’ Rank. If a site isn't appearing at all, the issue is likely at the first stage - crawling. Check robots.txt, server errors, and crawl accessibility BEFORE worrying about content quality or backlinks. No crawl = no index = no rankings."
