                                    content: "Here's a painful truth: most people target keywords that will NEVER bring them traffic. They either go after impossibly competitive terms ('weight loss') or ultra-specific phrases nobody searches ('organic vegan weight loss smoothies for left-handed people').\n\nKeyword research is the foundation of every successful SEO strategy. Get it wrong, and you'll spend months creating content that nobody finds. Get it right, and you'll discover hidden opportunities your competitors missed.\n\nIn this lesson, you'll learn to find the 'Goldilocks keywords' - terms with enough search volume to matter, but low enough competition that you can actually rank. This is where SEO fortunes are made.",
