                                    title: "Your Keyword Research Action Plan",
                                    content: "**This Week: Build Your Keyword Foundation**\n\n**Day 1: Seed List (30 mins)**\n• Brainstorm 10 topics your audience cares about\n• Write down problems your product/service solves\n• List questions customers frequently ask you\n\n**Day 2: Expand with Google (45 mins)**\n• Search each seed topic in Google\n• Capture autocomplete suggestions\n• Note 'People Also Ask' questions\n• Record related searches\n\n**Day 3: Competitive Research (30 mins)**\n• Find 3 competitors ranking for your topics\n• Use 'site:competitor.com [topic]' to find their content\n• Note which keywords they target\n\n**Day 4: Organize & Prioritize (45 mins)**\n• Group keywords into topic clusters\n• Estimate difficulty (check # of results, domain authority of page 1)\n• Star keywords with low competition + decent volume\n\n**Day 5: Create Your Content Plan**\n• Map each priority keyword to a content piece\n• Identify pillar pages vs cluster content\n• Schedule content creation\n\n**Tool tip:** Use a free Google Sheet to track keywords, volume estimates, and content assignments."
