                                    explanation: "Each page should have exactly ONE H1 tag - it's the main title/topic of that page. Multiple H1s confuse Google about what the page is primarily about. Use H2s and H3s to structure subsections. Think of H1 as the book title, H2s as chapter titles, and H3s as section headers within chapters."
