                                    title: "The Foundation Nobody Sees",
                                    content: "You can have the best content in the world, but if your technical SEO is broken, Google might never find it - or worse, it might find it but decide not to rank it.\n\nTechnical SEO is the infrastructure that supports everything else. It's like the foundation of a house: invisible but critical.\n\n**The Good News:** You don't need to be a developer. 80% of technical SEO comes down to a handful of fundamentals:\n\n• Can Google crawl and index your pages?\n• Does your site load fast?\n• Is it mobile-friendly?\n• Is it secure (HTTPS)?\n• Is the site structure logical?\n\nFix these, and you've solved most technical SEO problems. Let's break down each one.",
