                                    content: "**Run through this checklist for your site:**\n\n**Crawlability**\nâ–¡ robots.txt isn't blocking important pages\nâ–¡ XML sitemap exists and is submitted to GSC\nâ–¡ No major crawl errors in Search Console\nâ–¡ Important pages are indexable (no noindex tags)\n\n**Speed (Test at PageSpeed Insights)**\nâ–¡ LCP under 2.5 seconds\nâ–¡ FID under 100ms\nâ–¡ CLS under 0.1\nâ–¡ Images are compressed\nâ–¡ Browser caching enabled\n\n**Mobile**\nâ–¡ Passes Google's Mobile-Friendly Test\nâ–¡ Text readable without zooming\nâ–¡ Buttons/links are tap-friendly\nâ–¡ No intrusive pop-ups\n\n**Security**\nâ–¡ HTTPS enabled (padlock showing)\nâ–¡ No mixed content warnings\nâ–¡ SSL certificate is valid\nâ–¡ HTTP redirects to HTTPS\n\n**Structure**\nâ–¡ Clear URL structure\nâ–¡ Logical site hierarchy\nâ–¡ No orphan pages (pages with no links)\nâ–¡ Working internal links (no 404s)\n\n**Tools to Use:**\n• Google Search Console (free)\n• PageSpeed Insights (free)\n• Screaming Frog (free up to 500 URLs)\n• Ahrefs/SEMrush Site Audit (paid)"
