                                    type: "intro",
                                    title: "The Currency of the Web",
                                    content: "If content is king, links are the kingdom's currency. Backlinks - links from other websites to yours - remain one of the strongest ranking factors.\n\nWhy? Because links are votes of confidence. When a reputable site links to you, they're saying 'this content is valuable enough to recommend.' Google sees these votes and rewards you with higher rankings.\n\nBut here's what's changed: quality now trumps quantity. One link from a respected industry publication beats 100 links from random blogs. And manipulative link schemes can get you penalized.\n\nIn this lesson, you'll learn how to earn high-quality backlinks through strategies that are sustainable, ethical, and effective. No black-hat tricks - just real value creation.",
