                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Google Business Profile Optimization",
                                    content: "Your Google Business Profile (GBP) is the foundation of local SEO. It's what powers your appearance in Maps and the Local Pack.\n\n**Essential GBP Optimizations:**\n\n**1. Complete Every Field**\n• Business name (exact legal name - no keyword stuffing!)\n• Address (if you serve customers at your location)\n• Phone number (local number preferred)\n• Website URL\n• Hours of operation\n• Business category (be specific!)\n\n**2. Choose the Right Categories**\n• Primary category = most important\n• Add relevant secondary categories\n• 'Therapist' is better than 'Mental Health Service'\n\n**3. Write a Compelling Description**\n• 750 characters max\n• Include keywords naturally\n• Highlight what makes you unique\n• Include a call to action\n\n**4. Add Photos & Videos**\n• Businesses with photos get 42% more requests for directions\n• Add exterior, interior, team, and work photos\n• Update regularly\n\n**5. Use Google Posts**\n• Share updates, offers, events\n• Posts appear in your listing\n• Keeps your profile fresh and active",
