                                    content: "**Step 1: Set Up Tracking (Today)**\nâ–¡ Verify Google Search Console access\nâ–¡ Set up GA4 with conversion tracking\nâ–¡ Link GSC and GA4 together\nâ–¡ Install a rank tracking tool\n\n**Step 2: Define Your KPIs**\nâ–¡ List 5-7 metrics that matter to YOUR business\nâ–¡ Set baseline measurements\nâ–¡ Define targets for each metric\nâ–¡ Determine reporting frequency\n\n**Step 3: Create Your Dashboard**\nâ–¡ Use Looker Studio (free) or similar\nâ–¡ Connect GSC + GA4 data\nâ–¡ Build visualizations for each KPI\nâ–¡ Set up automated email reports\n\n**Suggested Dashboard Sections:**\n1. Overall organic traffic trend\n2. Top 10 pages by traffic\n3. Keyword rankings for money terms\n4. Conversions from organic\n5. Page speed/Core Web Vitals\n6. Top referring domains\n\n**Review Schedule:**\n• Daily: Check for major issues\n• Weekly: Review key metrics\n• Monthly: Deep analysis + strategy adjustments\n• Quarterly: ROI calculation and planning",
