                                    content: "Here's your prioritized roadmap. Focus on high-impact activities first.\n\n**Days 1-30: Foundation**\n\nâ–¡ Set up Google Search Console\nâ–¡ Set up Google Analytics 4\nâ–¡ Run technical SEO audit (fix critical issues)\nâ–¡ Claim/optimize Google Business Profile\nâ–¡ Perform keyword research for main services\nâ–¡ Optimize homepage and 3 top pages\nâ–¡ Set baseline metrics\n\n**Days 31-60: Content & Authority**\n\nâ–¡ Create content calendar\nâ–¡ Publish 4 strategic blog posts\nâ–¡ Build 1 comprehensive pillar page\nâ–¡ Optimize 5 existing pages\nâ–¡ Start review collection campaign\nâ–¡ Begin link building outreach\nâ–¡ Fix remaining technical issues\n\n**Days 61-90: Scale & Refine**\n\nâ–¡ Publish 4 more strategic posts\nâ–¡ Build cluster content for pillar\nâ–¡ Analyze what's working (double down)\nâ–¡ Identify what's not (adjust)\nâ–¡ Continue link building\nâ–¡ Plan next quarter's priorities\n\n**Remember:** This is a marathon, not a sprint. Consistent weekly effort beats intense sporadic work.",
