                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Claiming and Verifying Your Profile",
                                    content: "**Step 1: Claim your profile**\n\nGo to google.com/business and search for your practice. If it exists, claim it. If not, create it.\n\n**Step 2: Verification (CRITICAL)**\n\nGoogle must verify you're the actual business owner. Methods:\n• **Postcard**: Most common—takes 5-14 days\n• **Phone**: Automated call with verification code\n• **Email**: If your domain matches the business\n• **Video**: Record yourself at the location\n• **Instant**: Sometimes available for established businesses\n\n**Verification tips:**\n• Use your EXACT legal business name\n• Address must be where you see clients\n• Don't change anything during verification\n• Keep verification code private\n\n**Warning:** Never pay someone to 'verify' your listing. Scammers charge for what's free."
