                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "Writing Your Business Description",
                                    content: "You have 750 characters to describe your practice. This should be keyword-rich but natural.\n\n**Example description:**\n\n\"Healing Horizons Counseling provides compassionate therapy services in Austin, TX. Our licensed therapists specialize in anxiety treatment, depression counseling, trauma therapy, and couples counseling. We offer both in-person sessions at our comfortable South Austin office and secure telehealth appointments throughout Texas.\n\nOur approach combines evidence-based methods including CBT, EMDR, and mindfulness-based therapy. Whether you're struggling with life transitions, relationship issues, or chronic stress, we're here to help. Most insurance accepted. New clients welcome—contact us today to schedule your free 15-minute consultation.\n\nServing Austin, Round Rock, Cedar Park, and surrounding areas.\"\n\n**Notice:** Location mentioned, services listed, keywords included, call-to-action present."
