                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Photos: The Trust Builders",
                                    content: "Businesses with photos receive **42% more requests for directions** and **35% more click-throughs** to their websites.\n\n**Photos to upload:**\n\n• **Logo** (your brand mark)\n• **Cover photo** (welcoming exterior or interior)\n• **Exterior** (building, entrance, parking)\n• **Interior** (waiting room, office, therapy room)\n• **Team** (professional headshots—optional for confidentiality)\n• **At work** (desk, bookshelf, credentials on wall)\n\n**Photo guidelines:**\n• Minimum 720px wide\n• JPG or PNG format\n• Well-lit, high quality\n• No heavy filters\n• Show warmth and professionalism\n\n**For therapy practices:** Balance professionalism with warmth. Clients want to see a welcoming, comfortable space. Avoid sterile clinical photos—show where healing happens."
