                                    content: "Local keyword research answers a fundamental question: **What words do people in your area use when searching for your services?**\n\nThe therapist who ranks #1 for 'anxiety therapist Dallas' gets clients. The therapist who optimized for 'psychotherapeutic intervention specialist' wonders why the phone isn't ringing.\n\nLocal keyword research combines:\n• **Service keywords** (what you do)\n• **Geographic modifiers** (where you are)\n• **Intent qualifiers** (what stage they're at)\n\nGet this right, and your website becomes a client magnet. Get it wrong, and you're invisible to the people who need you most.",
