                                    title: "Service Keywords for Therapy Practices",
                                    content: "**Core service terms:**\n• Therapist, counselor, psychologist\n• Therapy, counseling, mental health\n• Psychotherapy, treatment\n\n**Specialty-specific:**\n• Anxiety therapist, depression counselor\n• Trauma therapist, PTSD treatment\n• Marriage counselor, couples therapy\n• Family therapist, child psychologist\n• Addiction counselor, substance abuse treatment\n• Grief counselor, bereavement therapy\n\n**Approach-based:**\n• CBT therapist, EMDR therapy\n• Mindfulness-based therapy\n• Psychodynamic therapist\n\n**Format-based:**\n• Online therapist, telehealth counseling\n• In-person therapy\n• Evening/weekend therapy\n\n**Think like your client:** They search symptoms and solutions, not clinical terminology. 'Help with anxiety' beats 'generalized anxiety disorder treatment.'"
