                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "On-Page SEO Fundamentals",
                                    content: "**On-page SEO** optimizes individual pages to rank for target keywords. Key elements:\n\n**Title Tag** (60 characters max)\n• Most important on-page element\n• Include primary keyword + location\n• Example: 'Anxiety Therapist Austin TX | Healing Horizons Counseling'\n\n**Meta Description** (155 characters)\n• Doesn't directly affect ranking but affects click-through\n• Include keyword, location, and call-to-action\n\n**H1 Heading**\n• One per page, contains primary keyword\n• Example: 'Anxiety Therapy in Austin, Texas'\n\n**Content**\n• Naturally include keywords throughout\n• Aim for 800-1500 words on service pages\n• Include location mentions 2-4 times\n\n**URL Structure**\n• Clean, keyword-rich URLs\n• Example: /anxiety-therapy-austin/"
