                                    title: "Location Pages: Expanding Your Reach",
                                    content: "If you serve multiple areas, create **location-specific pages** for each.\n\n**Page structure:**\n• /anxiety-therapy-austin/\n• /anxiety-therapy-round-rock/\n• /anxiety-therapy-cedar-park/\n\n**Each page needs:**\n• Unique content (NOT copy-paste with city name swapped)\n• Local details (nearby landmarks, neighborhoods served)\n• Local testimonials if possible\n• Embedded Google Map for that area\n• Local phone number or mention of service area\n\n**Content ideas for uniqueness:**\n• Mention specific neighborhoods\n• Reference local landmarks or features\n• Discuss community mental health resources\n• Address area-specific stressors\n\n**Warning:** Thin, duplicate location pages can hurt rankings. Each page must provide genuine value—at least 500-800 words of unique content."
