                                    title: "NAP Consistency in Action",
                                    content: "**The Problem:**\n\nGoogle finds these listings for 'Austin Therapy Center':\n\n• Google: Austin Therapy Center, 123 Main St, (512) 555-1234\n• Yelp: Austin Therapy Center LLC, 123 Main Street, 512-555-1234\n• Psychology Today: Austin Therapy, 123 Main St Suite 100, (512) 555-1234\n• Facebook: The Austin Therapy Center, 123 Main, 512.555.1234\n\n**Google's confusion:**\n'Are these the same business? The names are different. The addresses vary. I'm less confident about this business.'\n\n**The Solution:**\n\nPick ONE exact format:\n• **Name:** Austin Therapy Center (no LLC, no 'The')\n• **Address:** 123 Main St, Suite 100, Austin, TX 78701\n• **Phone:** (512) 555-1234\n\nUse this EXACT format on every single listing. Audit and correct all inconsistencies."
