                                    title: "Local Link Building Strategies",
                                    content: "**1. Sponsorships & Donations**\n• Sponsor local events (5Ks, school programs)\n• Donate to local charities (get on donor pages)\n• Support community organizations\n\n**2. Guest Contributions**\n• Write for local health blogs\n• Contribute to community newsletters\n• Guest on local podcasts\n• Provide expert quotes to local journalists\n\n**3. Partnerships**\n• Cross-referral with complementary providers\n• Resource page exchanges (ethical linking)\n• Joint workshops or webinars\n\n**4. Content That Earns Links**\n• 'Mental Health Resources in [City]' guide\n• Local stress/wellness survey results\n• Infographics about therapy access\n• Seasonal mental health guides\n\n**5. Professional Associations**\n• State licensing boards\n• Professional organization member directories\n• Alumni association listings\n\n**Golden Rule:** Every link should be relevant, local, or industry-related."
