                                    type: "intro",
                                    title: "The Social Proof Engine",
                                    content: "**Reviews are the #2 ranking factor** in local SEO, accounting for about 16% of how Google ranks local businesses. But their impact goes far beyond rankings.\n\nWhen someone searches 'therapist near me' and sees two options—one with 47 reviews (4.9 stars) and one with 3 reviews (4.0 stars)—they don't need Google to rank them. The choice is obvious.\n\nFor therapy practices, reviews carry extra weight. People seeking mental health support are vulnerable. They're looking for reassurance that they're making the right choice. Reviews provide that social proof: 'Others trusted this therapist and had good experiences. Maybe I can too.'\n\nManaging reviews isn't optional—it's essential for growth.",
