                                    title: "Review Request Templates",
                                    content: "**Email template (post-therapy relationship):**\n\n\"Hi [Name],\n\nIt's been wonderful working with you, and I'm glad to hear about your progress.\n\nIf you're comfortable, reviews help others who are searching for support find their way to therapy. If you'd be willing to share a few words about your experience, here's the link:\n\n[Google Review Link]\n\nNo pressure at all—your privacy is always the priority.\n\nWarmly,\n[Your name]\"\n\n---\n\n**Verbal script (in session):**\n\n\"You mentioned that finding me was a relief after searching. If you ever feel moved to leave a review, it really helps others who are searching find support. I have a card at the front desk with the link—completely optional.\"\n\n---\n\n**Key elements:** Optional, client-focused framing, easy access, zero pressure."
