                                    content: "You've optimized your Google Business Profile, built citations, gathered reviews, and created local content. But how do you know if it's working?\n\n**Local SEO measurement is tricky:**\n• Rankings vary by location (someone 2 miles away sees different results)\n• 'Near me' searches are personalized\n• Mobile vs. desktop results differ\n• Rankings fluctuate constantly\n\nWithout tracking, you're flying blind. You might be improving—or your competitors might be overtaking you—and you'd never know.\n\nThis lesson covers the tools and metrics that matter, so you can make data-driven decisions and continuously improve your local visibility.",
