                                    title: "Key Metrics to Track",
                                    content: "**Google Business Profile Insights (Free)**\n• **Searches**: How people found you (direct vs. discovery)\n• **Views**: Profile and photo views\n• **Actions**: Calls, direction requests, website clicks\n• **Search queries**: Actual terms people used\n\n**Website Analytics (Google Analytics)**\n• Organic traffic from local searches\n• Pages visited (which services interest people)\n• Time on site and bounce rate\n• Conversions (form fills, calls)\n\n**Ranking Positions**\n• Local Pack position (1-3 is visible)\n• Organic position for local keywords\n• Track multiple keywords across locations\n\n**Review Metrics**\n• Total review count\n• Average rating\n• Review velocity (new reviews per month)\n• Review response rate\n\n**Citation Health**\n• Total citation count\n• NAP consistency score\n• Duplicate listings"
