                                    title: "Free Tracking Tools",
                                    content: "**Google Business Profile Insights**\n• Built into your GBP dashboard\n• Shows searches, views, actions\n• Reveals actual search queries\n• Free and essential\n\n**Google Search Console**\n• Shows your website's search performance\n• Queries driving traffic\n• Click-through rates\n• Index coverage issues\n• Free, set up required\n\n**Google Analytics 4**\n• Website traffic sources\n• User behavior\n• Conversion tracking\n• Free, set up required\n\n**Manual Rank Checking**\n• Use incognito mode\n• Search from different locations (use VPN or Google's location settings)\n• Track weekly in a spreadsheet\n• Free but time-consuming\n\n**Google Alerts**\n• Monitor mentions of your practice name\n• Track competitor activity\n• Free"
