                                    title: "Diagnosing Ranking Issues",
                                    content: "**If rankings dropped suddenly:**\n• Check for Google algorithm updates\n• Review GBP for suspension/issues\n• Look for new competitors\n• Check for duplicate listings\n• Verify NAP consistency hasn't changed\n\n**If not improving despite effort:**\n• Competitor analysis—what are they doing better?\n• Review quantity/quality gap\n• Citation quality vs. competitors\n• On-page SEO weaknesses\n• Content gaps for target keywords\n\n**Common issues:**\n• **GBP not verified** - Rankings capped\n• **Wrong primary category** - Missing relevant searches\n• **Few/old reviews** - Losing to competitors\n• **NAP inconsistencies** - Confusing Google\n• **Weak website SEO** - Limited organic support\n• **No local content** - Missing location relevance signals\n\n**Fix one thing at a time.** Wait 2-4 weeks to see impact before making more changes."
