                                    content: "There are two mindsets you can bring to your working life. The **passion mindset** asks: What can the world offer ME? The **craftsman mindset** asks: What can I offer the WORLD?\n\nNewport argues the craftsman mindset is the foundation of a career you love. It flips the script from entitled seeking to valuable creating. And it's the only path that actually works.",
