                                    content: "**This week, practice these shifts:**\n\n1. **Stop asking:** \"Is this job fulfilling?\" â†’ **Start asking:** \"What skills can I develop here?\"\n\n2. **Stop noticing:** What you don't like about your work â†’ **Start noticing:** Opportunities to improve\n\n3. **Stop waiting:** For motivation to strike â†’ **Start doing:** The hard work of skill development\n\n4. **Stop comparing:** Your job to idealized alternatives â†’ **Start competing:** With your past self\n\n**The mantra:** What rare and valuable skills am I building TODAY?"
