                                    title: "Beyond Hourly Billing",
                                    content: "Most consultants make a fatal mistake: they charge by the hour. This commoditizes their expertise, punishes efficiency, and creates adversarial client relationships. Every time you get faster, you earn less.\n\nAlan Weiss built a multi-million dollar solo consulting practice by doing the opposite: **charging based on VALUE delivered**, not time spent. When you save a client $2 million, whether it takes 10 hours or 100 hours is irrelevant. Your fee should reflect the outcome, not the input.\n\nThis shift—from selling time to selling value—is the foundation of million dollar consulting. It changes everything: how you position yourself, how you price, how you deliver, and ultimately, how much you earn.",
