                                    title: "Reframing Your Services",
                                    content: "**Instead of:** 'I provide leadership training'\n**Say:** 'I help companies reduce management turnover and improve team productivity by developing leaders who retain talent'\n\n**Instead of:** 'I do strategic planning'\n**Say:** 'I help companies identify and capture market opportunities that add $X million in revenue'\n\n**Instead of:** 'I'm a marketing consultant'\n**Say:** 'I help professional service firms double their qualified leads while cutting acquisition costs by 40%'\n\n**The pattern:**\n• Lead with the OUTCOME (what changes)\n• Quantify when possible\n• Make it about THEM, not you\n\n**Test:** If your description sounds like it could come from any consultant, it's too generic. Be specific about the transformation you create."
