                                    type: "takeaway",
                                    title: "Key Takeaways",
                                    content: "• Value proposition answers: **Why hire YOU?**\n• Four components: **Target, Problem, Approach, Results**\n• **Specialization beats generalization** for premium fees\n• The narrower your niche, the **less competition** you face\n• Create **proprietary methodologies** with names\n• Build **gravity** so clients come to you\n• Focus on **client transformation**, not your credentials\n• Include **quantified results** when possible\n• Your value proposition should **attract AND repel**\n• **Test:** Would an ideal client say 'That's exactly what I need'?"
