                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "The Economic Buyer",
                                    content: "**The economic buyer** is the person who can say YES without needing approval. This is who you MUST reach.\n\n**Economic buyers are typically:**\n• CEOs, Presidents, Owners\n• Division/Business Unit heads\n• C-suite executives (CFO, COO, CMO)\n• Partners in professional firms\n\n**NOT economic buyers:**\n• HR (for non-HR issues)\n• Procurement/Purchasing\n• Middle management\n• 'Evaluation committees'\n\n**Why this matters:**\n• Non-buyers can only say NO\n• They filter you out to protect themselves\n• They focus on cost, not value\n• They can't make value-based decisions\n• They extend sales cycles endlessly\n\n**Rule:** If you're not talking to someone who can write a check, you're wasting time. Find the economic buyer or walk away."
