                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "Reaching Economic Buyers",
                                    content: "**Scenario:** You want to reach CEOs of mid-size manufacturing companies.\n\n**Wrong approach:**\n• Cold email blast to purchased list\n• Cold calling through gatekeepers\n• LinkedIn spam messages\n• Waiting for them to find you\n\n**Right approach:**\n\n**1. Speak where they gather**\n• Manufacturing industry conferences\n• Trade association events\n• Executive peer groups (Vistage, YPO)\n\n**2. Publish where they read**\n• Industry trade publications\n• Write a book on their problems\n• Guest on industry podcasts\n\n**3. Get introduced**\n• Ask existing clients for introductions\n• Build relationships with their advisors (accountants, lawyers, bankers)\n• Network in their communities\n\n**4. Demonstrate expertise**\n• Case studies from similar companies\n• Speaking on their specific challenges\n• Research/insights on their industry"
