                                    content: "**Not all revenue is good revenue.** Bad clients drain energy, destroy margins, and prevent you from serving ideal clients.\n\n**Red flags to watch for:**\n\n**Fee pressure early**\n• 'What's your hourly rate?'\n• 'Can you give us a discount?'\n• 'Our budget is limited'\n\n**No clear decision maker**\n• 'The committee will decide'\n• 'I need to check with...'\n• Endless stakeholder meetings\n\n**Unrealistic expectations**\n• Wants guarantees you can't give\n• Timeline doesn't match reality\n• Expects miracles with no internal effort\n\n**Disrespectful behavior**\n• Misses meetings or is unprepared\n• Doesn't value your time\n• Treats you as vendor, not advisor\n\n**History of consultant churn**\n• 'We've tried consultants before...'\n• Multiple failed engagements\n• Blames external help, not internal issues\n\n**When in doubt, walk away.** Scarcity mindset kills practices."
