                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "The Thought Leadership Platform",
                                    content: "**Build your platform on four pillars:**\n\n**1. Publishing**\n• Articles in industry publications\n• Blog posts and newsletters\n• White papers and research\n• A BOOK (the ultimate authority builder)\n\n**2. Speaking**\n• Industry conferences\n• Association meetings\n• Corporate events\n• Webinars and podcasts\n\n**3. Teaching**\n• Workshops and seminars\n• Online courses\n• Certification programs\n• Mentoring other consultants\n\n**4. Media**\n• Quoted in publications\n• Podcast guest appearances\n• Video content\n• Social media presence\n\n**The multiplier effect:** Each pillar reinforces the others. Speakers get asked to write. Writers get invited to speak. Teachers build communities that spread the word."
