                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "Speaking That Generates Business",
                                    content: "**Free speaking that pays:**\n\nSpeak at industry conferences where your ideal clients gather. Don't charge a speaking fee—use it to generate consulting leads.\n\n**The formula:**\n1. **Provide immense value** (don't hold back)\n2. **Tell stories** that illustrate your expertise\n3. **Offer a valuable takeaway** (handout, tool, assessment)\n4. **Mention your book/methodology** naturally\n5. **Make yourself available** after the talk\n\n**What to avoid:**\n• Overt selling from stage\n• Holding back the 'good stuff'\n• Reading slides\n• Generic content anyone could deliver\n\n**The follow-up:**\n• Send your slides to attendees\n• Include additional resources\n• Offer a conversation for interested parties\n\n**Goal:** 3-5 qualified conversations per speech. One $50K engagement from a free speech = infinite ROI."
