                                    content: "There's a ceiling to solo consulting: your time. Even at premium fees, if YOU are required for every engagement, growth is limited.\n\n**Million dollar consultants break through by:**\n• Creating leverage through products and licensing\n• Building passive income streams\n• Developing intellectual property that sells\n• Strategically using subcontractors\n• Maximizing value of time spent\n\nThe goal isn't necessarily to build a large firm—it's to build a practice that generates significant income while allowing the lifestyle you want.\n\nThis might mean $1M solo, or $5M with a small team, or $500K working 20 hours a week. Define success for yourself.",
