                                    content: "Over **57 million Americans** are freelancers—and that number is growing. But freelancing isn't just a job; it's a complete **lifestyle shift** that requires a new way of thinking about work, security, and success.\n\nSara Horowitz founded the Freelancers Union and has spent decades helping independent workers thrive. Her key insight? **Freelancing is a business**, not just doing your old job without a boss.\n\nThis course will give you everything you need: the mindset, the systems, the legal knowledge, and the practical skills to build a **sustainable freelance career**. Whether you're escaping the corporate world, building a side hustle, or going all-in on independence, you'll learn how to do it right.",
