                                    content: "Pricing is where most freelancers leave the most money on the table. They price based on what they think they're 'worth,' what competitors charge, or what feels comfortable—none of which optimize for success.\n\nHorowitz's approach: **Price based on value delivered**, not time spent. A logo that transforms a brand isn't worth $200 just because it took 2 hours. It's worth thousands because of the **business impact**.\n\nThis lesson covers pricing models, how to determine your rates, negotiation tactics, and the psychology of pricing. Master this, and you'll dramatically increase your income without working more hours.",
