                                    content: "**Marcus**, a UX designer, used to charge $3,000 for app redesigns. Here's how he restructured using **tiered pricing**:\n\n**Option A: Basic Redesign - $3,000**\n• Visual refresh of existing screens\n• No user research\n• 2 revision rounds\n\n**Option B: Strategic Redesign - $8,000** ⭐ RECOMMENDED\n• User research and journey mapping\n• Complete UX overhaul\n• 3 revision rounds\n• Implementation support\n\n**Option C: Growth Package - $15,000**\n• Everything in B\n• A/B testing setup\n• 3 months of conversion optimization\n• Guaranteed 20%+ conversion improvement\n\n**Results:**\n• Previously: 100% chose $3,000\n• Now: 20% choose A, 60% choose B, 20% choose C\n• Average project value: $8,600 (was $3,000)\n\n**The Psychology:** Option A makes B look reasonable. Option C makes B look like great value. The middle option wins."
