                                    title: "The Reinvention Story",
                                    content: "**Tom** was a successful print designer for 15 years. Then print died.\n\nHis skills were becoming obsolete. Income dropped 40% over two years. He faced a choice: fight the change or reinvent.\n\n**His Reinvention:**\n\n**Year 1:** While still taking print work, he:\n• Took online courses in UX/UI design\n• Did free projects to build a digital portfolio\n• Attended web design meetups\n\n**Year 2:**\n• Offered 'print + digital' packages at discount\n• Got referrals from former clients to their digital teams\n• Gradually shifted ratio: 50% print, 50% digital\n\n**Year 3:**\n• Positioned as a specialist in 'brand system design'\n• Combined print expertise with digital skills\n• Unique positioning that pure digital designers lacked\n\n**Year 5:**\n• Income 50% higher than print peak\n• Works with bigger clients than before\n• Known for bridging physical and digital brand experiences\n\n**Lesson:** The ability to reinvent is the ultimate job security. Always be learning."
