                                    title: "Creating Charts",
                                    content: "**Basic Steps**:\n1. Select your data (including headers)\n2. Insert tab â†’ Charts group â†’ Choose type\n3. Or use **Alt+F1** for quick default chart\n\n**Chart Elements** (click + icon on chart):\n• Chart Title - Descriptive, clear\n• Axis Titles - What's being measured\n• Legend - Identify data series\n• Data Labels - Show exact values\n• Gridlines - Aid reading values\n• Trendline - Show direction\n\n**Tip**: Include headers in selection for automatic labels"
