                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "Customizing Charts",
                                    content: "**Chart Design tab** (appears when chart selected):\n• Quick Layout - Pre-made arrangements\n• Change Colors - Color schemes\n• Switch Row/Column - Flip data orientation\n• Select Data - Modify data range\n\n**Format tab**:\n• Shape Fill/Outline - Customize colors\n• WordArt Styles - Format titles\n• Size - Precise dimensions\n\n**Right-click any element** for specific formatting:\n• Format Data Series - Bar width, gap, colors\n• Format Axis - Scale, number format\n• Add Data Labels - Position, format"
