                                    title: "Custom Validation with Formulas",
                                    content: "**Formula must return TRUE for valid entry**:\n\n**Example 1: Only uppercase**:\n`=EXACT(A1,UPPER(A1))`\n\n**Example 2: Must start with \"PT-\"**:\n`=LEFT(A1,3)=\"PT-\"`\n\n**Example 3: No duplicates**:\n`=COUNTIF($A:$A,A1)=1`\n\n**Example 4: Future dates only**:\n`=A1>TODAY()`\n\n**Example 5: Email format**:\n`=ISNUMBER(FIND(\"@\",A1))`\n\n**Tip**: Use relative reference (A1) for first cell in range"
