                                    content: "Styles are **named sets of formatting** that you apply with one click. Templates are **pre-formatted documents** you can reuse. Together, they ensure consistency and save enormous amounts of time.\n\nIn healthcare organizations, styles and templates maintain brand standards, ensure compliance, and streamline document creation across departments."
