                                    title: "Remember M.I.C.E. - Who We Really Were",
                                    content: "Use **M.I.C.E.** to remember humanity's true position for 99.5% of our existence:\n\n**M** - **Middle of the food chain**\nWe weren't apex predators. Lions ate us. We scavenged their leftovers.\n\n**I** - **Impact was zero**\nOur ecological footprint was no greater than gorillas, fireflies, or jellyfish.\n\n**C** - **Couldn't compete physically**\nA chimp could tear us apart. We traded muscle for neurons and lost raw strength.\n\n**E** - **Energy-hungry brains**\nOur 2% brain consumed 25% of calories—a costly gamble that took millions of years to pay off.\n\nWe weren't kings. We were **M.I.C.E.** hiding from real predators.",
