                                    explanation: "MYO = muscle. CARDI = heart. INFARCTION = tissue death from lack of blood. Myocardial Infarction (MI) = death of heart muscle tissue = 'heart attack.' This is one of the most commonly coded conditions. ICD-10 codes are in the I21-I22 range for acute MI."
