                                    content: "Medical abbreviations save time but can be **dangerous if misunderstood**. The Joint Commission maintains a \"Do Not Use\" list of abbreviations that are too easily confused.\n\nAs an HIM professional, you must know both common abbreviations AND which ones to avoid. This lesson covers the most essential abbreviations by category.",
