                                    content: "**Anatomy** is the study of body STRUCTURE—what things look like and where they're located.\n\n**Physiology** is the study of body FUNCTION—how things work.\n\nThese two fields are inseparable: **structure determines function**, and function reflects structure. You can't understand how the heart pumps blood without knowing its chambers and valves.",
