                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Clinical Documentation - Core Components",
                                    content: "**HISTORY & PHYSICAL (H&P):**\n• Chief Complaint (CC) - Why patient is here\n• History of Present Illness (HPI)\n• Past Medical/Surgical History (PMH/PSH)\n• Family History (FH)\n• Social History (SH)\n• Review of Systems (ROS)\n• Physical Examination\n• Assessment/Impression\n• Plan of Care\n• **Must be completed within 24 hours of admission**\n\n**PROGRESS NOTES:**\n• Daily documentation of patient status\n• Response to treatment\n• Changes in condition\n• Often use SOAP format:\n  - **S**ubjective - Patient's symptoms\n  - **O**bjective - Exam findings, test results\n  - **A**ssessment - Diagnosis/condition\n  - **P**lan - Treatment plan\n\n**PHYSICIAN ORDERS:**\n• All care requires physician order\n• Medications, treatments, diets, activities\n• Must be signed, dated, timed"
