                                    content: "**SEPSIS (A40-A41):**\n• Systemic infection\n• Code the specific organism\n• A41.9 if unspecified organism\n\n**CODING SEPSIS:**\n1. Code for sepsis (A40-A41)\n2. Code for organism (B95-B97) if not included\n3. Code any localized infection\n\n**SEVERE SEPSIS (R65.2-):**\n• Sepsis WITH organ dysfunction\n• Requires TWO codes minimum:\n  - Underlying infection (A40-A41)\n  - R65.20 or R65.21 (with/without septic shock)\n\n**SEQUENCING:**\n• Sepsis as reason â†’ Sepsis first\n• Localized infection leading to sepsis â†’ Sepsis first\n• Post-procedural sepsis â†’ Code T81.4- first\n\n**SEPTIC SHOCK (R65.21):**\n• Always codes WITH severe sepsis\n• Never principal diagnosis\n• Sequence: Sepsis â†’ R65.21 â†’ Organ dysfunction\n\n**UROSEPSIS ≠SEPSIS:**\n• Urosepsis is nonspecific â†’ Query"
