                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Understanding Neoplasm Behavior",
                                    content: "**MALIGNANT (Cancerous):**\n\n**Primary (C00-C75, C76-C80):**\n• Where cancer STARTED\n• The original site\n\n**Secondary/Metastatic (C77-C79):**\n• Where cancer SPREAD TO\n• From a primary site elsewhere\n• C77 = Lymph node metastasis\n• C78 = Respiratory/digestive metastasis\n• C79 = Other site metastasis\n\n**Carcinoma in Situ (D00-D09):**\n• Pre-invasive\n• Has NOT broken through basement membrane\n• \"Stage 0\" cancer\n\n**NON-MALIGNANT:**\n\n**Benign (D10-D36):**\n• Non-cancerous growth\n• Doesn't invade or spread\n\n**Uncertain Behavior (D37-D48):**\n• Cannot determine if malignant or benign\n• Pathology unclear\n\n**Unspecified Behavior (D49):**\n• Documentation doesn't specify behavior\n• Query if possible"
