                                    explanation: "When treatment for malignancy is COMPLETED and there's NO EVIDENCE of disease, use a Z85.- code (Personal history of malignant neoplasm). The active cancer code is no longer used. Exception: \"In remission\" for leukemia/lymphoma uses the active code with appropriate characters."
