                                    content: "**IMMUNIZATION ADMINISTRATION** (How it's given):\n\n**Physician/QHP Counseling** (Age <19):\n• **90460**: First vaccine component\n• **+90461**: Each additional component\n• Requires face-to-face physician counseling\n\n**Without Counseling** (Any age):\n• **90471**: First injection (IM/SC)\n• **+90472**: Each additional injection\n• **90473**: First intranasal/oral\n• **+90474**: Each additional intranasal/oral\n\n**VACCINE PRODUCT** (What's given):\n• **Separate codes** for each vaccine product\n• Examples: 90707 (MMR), 90714 (Tdap), 90715 (Tdap adolescent)\n\n**BILLING PATTERN**:\nAlways report BOTH:\n1. Administration code (how given)\n2. Vaccine product code (what given)\n\n**Example**: Flu shot to adult\n• 90471 (IM injection administration)\n• 90686 (Quadrivalent flu vaccine)"
