                                    content: "**PHYSICAL MEDICINE CODES** (97010-97799):\n\n**MODALITIES** (Applied to patient):\n• **Supervised** (97010-97028): Hot/cold packs, electrical stimulation\n• **Constant Attendance** (97032-97039): Ultrasound, manual electrical stim\n\n**THERAPEUTIC PROCEDURES** (97110-97546):\n• **97110**: Therapeutic exercises (15 min)\n• **97112**: Neuromuscular re-education (15 min)\n• **97116**: Gait training (15 min)\n• **97140**: Manual therapy (15 min)\n• **97530**: Therapeutic activities (15 min)\n\n**TESTS AND MEASUREMENTS** (97161-97172):\n• Physical therapy evaluation (97161-97163)\n• Occupational therapy evaluation (97165-97167)\n• Athletic training evaluation (97169-97171)\n\n**8-MINUTE RULE** (Medicare):\nFor timed codes, must provide at least 8 minutes to bill one unit. Use total treatment time to determine units billable.\n\n**Direct one-on-one time** required for most therapy codes."
