                                    content: "**Release of Information (ROI)** is the process of disclosing patient health information to authorized requesters while protecting privacy.\n\nHIM professionals serve as **gatekeepers**, ensuring disclosures comply with HIPAA, state law, and organizational policy.\n\nImproper release can result in privacy violations, fines, lawsuits, and loss of patient trust.",
