                                    title: "Healthcare Fraud and Abuse",
                                    content: "**Healthcare fraud and abuse** cost the U.S. billions of dollars annually and can result in criminal prosecution, civil penalties, and exclusion from federal programs.\n\n**Fraud** is intentional deception for unauthorized benefit. **Abuse** involves practices inconsistent with accepted standards, whether intentional or not.\n\nHIM professionals must understand fraud schemes, abuse practices, and compliance program requirements.",
