                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "Payment Models Explained",
                                    content: "**Fee-for-Service (FFS)**\n• Payment for each service rendered\n• Volume-driven incentives\n• Traditional model\n\n**Prospective Payment Systems (PPS)**\n• Fixed payment per case/episode\n• DRGs (inpatient), APCs (outpatient)\n• Efficiency incentives\n\n**Capitation**\n• Fixed monthly payment per enrollee\n• Provider assumes financial risk\n• Used in HMOs, ACOs\n\n**Value-Based Payment**\n• Quality metrics affect payment\n• MIPS, bundled payments\n• Focus on outcomes, not volume"
