                                    type: "example",
                                    title: "FHIR - The Future Standard",
                                    content: "**FHIR (Fast Healthcare Interoperability Resources):**\n\n**What is FHIR?**\n• Modern API-based standard from HL7\n• Uses web technologies (REST, JSON, XML)\n• Resource-based approach\n• Easier implementation than older standards\n\n**Key Features:**\n• RESTful architecture\n• Granular data access\n• App-friendly design\n• Strong community support\n\n**Mandated Uses:**\n• Patient access APIs (21st Century Cures)\n• Payer-to-payer data exchange\n• Provider directory access\n• Electronic prior authorization"
