                                    type: "concept",
                                    title: "Respiratory Failure",
                                    content: "**Type 1 - Hypoxemic:**\n• PaO2 <60 mmHg\n• Normal or low CO2\n• V/Q mismatch, shunt, diffusion impairment\n• ICD-10: J96.01 (acute), J96.11 (chronic)\n\n**Type 2 - Hypercapnic:**\n• PaCO2 >50 mmHg\n• Hypoventilation\n• Often with hypoxemia\n• ICD-10: J96.02 (acute), J96.12 (chronic)\n\n**Combined (Type 1 + 2):**\n• Both hypoxemia AND hypercapnia\n• ICD-10: J96.00 (acute), J96.10 (chronic)"
