                                    title: "Front-End Revenue Cycle",
                                    content: "**Scheduling & Pre-Registration:**\n• Collect demographics, insurance info\n• Schedule appropriate resources\n\n**Insurance Verification:**\n• Confirm active coverage\n• Verify benefits, copays, deductibles\n• Prior authorization if required\n\n**Patient Registration:**\n• Verify/update information\n• Collect signatures (consent, HIPAA)\n• Point-of-service collections\n\n**Impact on Back-End:**\n• Errors here cause claim denials\n• Wrong insurance = wrong billing\n• Missing authorizations = no payment"
