                                    title: "Case Study: Multi-System Failure",
                                    content: "78-year-old admitted with acute hypoxic respiratory failure due to bacterial pneumonia. Develops acute kidney injury during stay. Has Type 2 DM with CKD Stage 3. Principal: J96.01 (acute resp failure with hypoxia). Secondary: J18.9 (pneumonia-etiology), N17.9 (AKI-MCC), E11.22 (DM with CKD-CC), N18.3 (CKD Stage 3)."
