                                    type: "visual",
                                    title: "Change Management Models",
                                    content: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                        <rect width="800" height="380" fill="#1a1a2e"/>
                                        <text x="628" y="110" fill="#00d4ff" font-size="21" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">Change Management Frameworks</text>
                                        <rect x="78" y="201" width="534" height="586" fill="#2d5a4a" rx="15"/>
                                        <text x="345" y="293" fill="#00ff88" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">Lewin's 3-Stage Model</text>
                                        <rect x="110" y="348" width="141" height="183" fill="#4a5568" rx="7"/>
                                        <text x="180" y="458" fill="#fff" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">UNFREEZE</text>
                                        <line x1="251" y1="440" x2="282" y2="440" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="4"/>
                                        <rect x="282" y="348" width="141" height="183" fill="#4a5568" rx="7"/>
                                        <text x="353" y="458" fill="#fff" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">CHANGE</text>
                                        <line x1="424" y1="440" x2="455" y2="440" stroke="#ffd700" stroke-width="4"/>
                                        <rect x="455" y="348" width="125" height="183" fill="#4a5568" rx="7"/>
                                        <text x="518" y="458" fill="#fff" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">REFREEZE</text>
                                        <text x="110" y="623" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">Unfreeze: Create urgency, readiness</text>
                                        <text x="110" y="689" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">Change: Implement new way</text>
                                        <text x="110" y="755" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">Refreeze: Stabilize, reinforce</text>
                                        <rect x="644" y="201" width="534" height="586" fill="#5a2d4a" rx="15"/>
                                        <text x="911" y="293" fill="#ff6b6b" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">Kotter's 8 Steps</text>
                                        <text x="675" y="385" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">1. Create urgency</text>
                                        <text x="675" y="447" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">2. Build coalition</text>
                                        <text x="675" y="509" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">3. Form vision</text>
                                        <text x="675" y="572" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">4. Communicate vision</text>
                                        <text x="895" y="385" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">5. Remove obstacles</text>
                                        <text x="895" y="447" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">6. Create quick wins</text>
                                        <text x="895" y="509" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">7. Build on change</text>
                                        <text x="895" y="572" fill="#ffffff" font-size="12">8. Anchor in culture</text>
                                        <text x="675" y="733" fill="#ffd700" font-size="12">Most failures occur in steps 1-4</text>
                                        <rect x="78" y="843" width="700" height="476" fill="#2d3a4a" rx="15"/>
                                        <text x="110" y="935" fill="#ffd700" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">Overcoming Resistance:</text>
                                        <text x="110" y="1026" fill="#ffffff" font-size="14">• Education: Explain the why - benefits, necessity</text>
                                        <text x="110" y="1100" fill="#ffffff" font-size="14">• Participation: Involve staff in planning, get input</text>
                                        <text x="110" y="1173" fill="#ffffff" font-size="14">• Support: Training, resources, time to adapt</text>
                                        <text x="628" y="1026" fill="#ffffff" font-size="14">• Negotiation: Address specific concerns</text>
                                        <text x="628" y="1100" fill="#ffffff" font-size="14">• Champions: Leverage influencers</text>
                                        <text x="628" y="1173" fill="#ff6b6b" font-size="14">• Coercion: Last resort for persistent resistance</text>
                                    </svg>`
